{"kind": "node", "eid": "4:df9fac94-d5b5-41ff-ac42-eba575a4d3f4:515", "labels": ["Chunk"], "props": {"section_title": "", "embeddingText": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "source_type": "text", "memory_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b", "_source_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b", "id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b_chunk_0000", "_ontology_name": "fibo_acc+be+fbc+fnd+ind", "created_at": "2026-08-02T01:15:28.146134+00:00", "char_start": 0, "_workspace_id": "armb-deepseek-c2373adb", "content_preview": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "token_count": 58, "chunk_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b_chunk_0000", "_ontology_version": "1.0.0", "_ontology_artifact_hash": "5bbc96b3f4e57f7b", "text": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "embedding_vector_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b_chunk_0000", "status": "active", "document_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-4f15-898f-64e6236e039b_doc", "source_id": "562d12e9-a4b6-